/-- The KAT vectors that the bench exercises. -/
def all : List KatVec := [test1, test2, test3]

/-! ## Structural sanity checks

`decide` validates the byte lengths and message-length consistency at
elaboration time. A typo in any vector above (off-by-one, missing byte,
extra byte) fails the build with a concrete error. -/

example : test1.seed.size = 32 := by decide
example : test1.pk.size   = 32 := by decide
example : test1.msg.size  = 0  := by decide
example : test1.sig.size  = 64 := by decide

example : test2.seed.size = 32 := by decide
example : test2.pk.size   = 32 := by decide
example : test2.msg.size  = 1  := by decide
example : test2.sig.size  = 64 := by decide

example : test3.seed.size = 32 := by decide
example : test3.pk.size   = 32 := by decide
example : test3.msg.size  = 2  := by decide
example : test3.sig.size  = 64 := by decide

/-- All KATs are well-shaped: 32-byte seed/pk, 64-byte sig, msg matches
    the announced length. -/
def wellShaped (k : KatVec) : Bool :=
  k.seed.size = 32 ∧ k.pk.size = 32 ∧ k.sig.size = 64

example : (all.all wellShaped) = true := by decide

/-! ## Open notes

- **test1024 / testabc**: RFC 8032 §7.1 has two more vectors covering
  long messages and SHA-512 input-length boundary conditions. They are
  not yet wired into the bench KAT loop. Adding them here without
  bench-side support is allowed (the structural checks still apply);
  flipping the bench to consume them is a follow-up.

- **Runtime equivalence**: the actual sign/verify path lives in
  `bench_ed25519_sign.c` (compiled C linking fiat-crypto + dalek_shim).
  Lean cannot compute the signatures without un-opaquing the field
  axioms — so the conformance gate is necessarily a separate shell
  invocation. See `scripts/check_kat_consistency.sh` (when written) for
  the diff between this file's bytes and the C `KATS[]` array.

- **Phase 3 hand-off**: when `scripts/extract_ed25519_rust.sh` activates
  (Phase 1.5 of `option-b-plan.md`), the certified Rust path inherits
  these vectors as its conformance gate too. -/

end CatCrypt.Crypto.Jasmin.Ed25519.KAT
